, "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.1", "Id": "10", "UID": 10010, "OID": 10010.0, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "87772", "Bowler_Name": "Ripon Mondol", "Batsman": "97114", "Batsman_Name": "Mirza Tahir Baig", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "No run.", "Timestamp": "2023-10-07T03:34:31+00:00", "Non_Striker": "64675", "Non_Striker_Name": "Khushdil Shah", "Score": "0/0", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "0", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "1", "Over_No": "1", "Ball": "1", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "0,", "Batsman_Details": {"Batsman": "97114", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "1", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, "Non_Striker_Details": {"Batsman": "64675", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "0", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, "Bowler_Details": {"Bowler": "87772", "Overs": "0.1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "0", "Wickets": "0"}, "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "0.1: Ripon Mondol to Mirza Tahir Baig, No run.", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "9", "UID": 10009, "OID": 10009.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "TOSS - The coin has landed in favor of Bangladesh\u00a0and they have decided to BOWL first.", "Timestamp": "2023-10-07T02:39:21+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "8", "UID": 10008, "OID": 10008.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "UPDATE - 7.28\u00a0am IST (1.58\u00a0am GMT) There is a slight drizzle happening at the ground and we have started to lose the overs now.", "Timestamp": "2023-10-07T01:58:28+00:00", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "7", "UID": 10007, "OID": 10007.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "UPDATE - 7.03\u00a0am IST (1.33\u00a0am GMT) Good news folks that the players could be seen doing their warm-ups but the covers are still firmly placed protecting the square.", "Timestamp": "2023-10-07T01:33:53+00:00", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "6", "UID": 10006, "OID": 10006.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "UPDATE - 6.27\u00a0am IST (12.57\u00a0am GMT) The game needs to start by 9.05\u00a0am IST (3.35 am GMT)\u00a0local time, to constitute a 5-over match. If not, Pakistan will be winning the bronze medal\u00a0by virtue of being the higher-ranked team.", "Timestamp": "2023-10-07T00:57:15+00:00", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "5", "UID": 10005, "OID": 10005.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "UPDATE - 6.14 am IST (12.44 am GMT) The toss has been delayed due to rain.", "Timestamp": "2023-10-07T00:44:03+00:00", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "4", "UID": 10004, "OID": 10004.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Bangladesh\u00a0just like their opponent for the day had a day to forget as they were thumped by India in the first Semi-final yesterday. The side has not batted well in both the games they have played so far but the bowling has shown some fight. To finish on the podium the Bangla Tigers need to be more clinical with the bat against one of the most lethal bowling units in Pakistan. With the Bronze Medal on the line let's see who comes out on top with\u00a0toss and team updates to follow.", "Timestamp": "2023-10-07T00:06:14+00:00", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "3", "UID": 10003, "OID": 10003.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Pakistan\u00a0had a bad outing against Afghanistan yesterday as they lost to the Afghans by 4 wickets. The batting for the Men in Green has not been on point and the top order has faltered massively. Arafat Minhas\u00a0has been one of the finds for Pakistan\u00a0so far with his all-round abilities coming good for the side. Pakistan\u00a0needs to bat well at the top as facing the Bangladesh\u00a0bowlers would not be easy by any stretch of the imagination.", "Timestamp": "2023-10-07T00:04:45+00:00", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "2", "UID": 10002, "OID": 10002.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Hello and welcome to everyone tuning in as we build up to the Bronze Medal match of the Asian Games 2023. Pakistan\u00a0takes on Bangladesh\u00a0at the ZJUT Cricket Field. Hangzhou, Zhejiang.", "Timestamp": "2023-10-07T00:03:56+00:00", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "1", "UID": 10001, "OID": 10001.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "...MATCHDAY...", "Timestamp": "2023-10-07T00:02:52+00:00", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "0", "UID": 10000, "OID": 10000.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "The time has come for Medals to be decided and it is the Bronze Medal match that is going to be played between Pakistan and Bangladesh. With both teams losing their respective Semi finals all is not lost as they still stand a chance to win this one and take a Medal back home. Bangladesh were completely outclassed by a masterclass performance from India as they lost by 9 wickets. Batting has faltered big time for Bangladesh while the bowlers couldn't keep up with the pressure that the Indian batters exerted on them. Pakistan on the other hand, had a torrid outing against Afghanistan as they lost the game by 6 wickets. Pakistan fought well to try and defend 115 but a bad decision to bring on pace in the 18th over cost them the game ultimately. The challenge for both sides would be to counter each other's bowling units as the batters have not enjoyed a good run in this campaign thus far. Who is going to end up with a podium finish and a Bronze Medal hanging by their neck seems to be seen as an exciting contest awaits us all.", "Timestamp": "2023-10-06T09:19:20+00:00", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}], "InningNo": "1", "BattingTeam_Id": "6", "BattingTeam": "Pakistan", "BowlingTeam_Id": "2", "BowlingTeam": "Bangladesh", "GameCode": "bapk10072023233407", "MatchId": "233407", "Timestamp": "10/07/2023T09:52:36+05:30", "Deleted_UID": []}, "meta": {"app_status_code": 1, "message": "Success", "pagination": true, "count": 43, "timestamp": {"utc_time": "6/20/2026 7:21:34 AM"}}}